The carry-over commands on `/portal/grants` assumed a `~/Projects/control` checkout and an active gcloud login. Since 5 October the laptop has neither. The old form also set `CONTROL_GCP_PROJECT` only for the first command, and `rehearse.sh reboot` refuses to run without it.

The page now shows the full sequence:

- clone control into `/tmp/ctl`;
- `export` the project;
- log in to gcloud;
- carry the config over and reboot the gateway;
- revoke the login again.

